    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\"> <ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Services </a> </li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Bookkeeping</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <div class=\"shell pt-6\"> <p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Services</p> <h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Bookkeeping</h1> <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Ongoing bookkeeping means your accounts are reconciled every month rather than rebuilt every June. It keeps the BAS right, shows what the business is actually earning while you can still act on it, and makes the annual return cheaper.</p> </div> <section class=\"shell mt-10\"> <div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"> <div class=\"card p-5\"> <p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Our fee</p> <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0\"> <span class=\"text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">from</span> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-2xl font-medium\">$199</span> <span class=\"ml-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">a month, inc. GST</span> </p> <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Set by your annual turnover, plus $15 per employee a month for payroll. Fixed, agreed in writing, no work begins before you accept it. </p> </div> <div class=\"card p-5\"> <p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Government charges</p> <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\"> None </p> <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Lodging your BAS through a registered agent costs nothing extra. You pay us for the work, not the lodgement. </p> </div> <div class=\"card p-5\"> <p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Who does it</p> <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">A registered tax agent</p> <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> BRS Advisory Pty Ltd, agent 26233684, CPA Australia Public Practice. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">Every client ID-verified</a> before work starts. </p> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"shell mt-16\"> <div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\"> <div> <h2 class=\"text-2xl\">What&#8217;s included</h2> <ul class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\"> <li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Bank and card reconciliation, monthly or quarterly</li><li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">BAS prepared and lodged through a registered agent</li><li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Payroll and Single Touch Payroll reporting</li><li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Accounts payable and receivable kept current</li><li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A profit and loss you can actually read, when it is still useful</li><li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Year-end file handed straight to the return — no re-keying</li> </ul> </div> <div> <h2 class=\"text-2xl\">How it runs</h2> <ol class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\"> <li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 01 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Verify your identity online — about three minutes on your phone, included in the fee. Every client, every service, no exceptions. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</span> </li><li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 02 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Tell us the software you use, your annual turnover, how many staff you pay, and what is currently behind.</span> </li><li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 03 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We quote on the real workload — not a headline rate that changes at invoice time.</span> </li><li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 04 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We catch up whatever is outstanding, then keep it current on an agreed cycle.</span> </li><li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 05 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Your BAS goes in on time, and your annual return starts from clean books.</span> </li> </ol> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"shell mt-16\"> <h2 class=\"text-2xl\">Start it</h2> <p class=\"mt-2 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Tell us what you need and we will come back with a fixed fee and what we need from you. No obligation, and no charge for telling you that you don&#8217;t need this. </p> <div class=\"card p-6\"> <p class=\"m-0 text-[0.9375rem]\">Pick your turnover and how many staff you pay, see the monthly fee straight away, then send the details for a fixed quote in writing.</p> <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"/services/bookkeeping/get-a-quote/\" class=\"btn text-sm\">Get a bookkeeping quote</a> <a href=\"/services/pricing/#run-your-business\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">See all fees</a> </div> </div> <p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Prefer to talk it through? Call 0407 179 179 and we will take the details over the phone. Please don&#8217;t include your tax file number either way — we ask for it securely once an accountant is working on your file. </p> </section> <section class=\"shell mt-16\"> <h2 class=\"text-xl\">Work the numbers first</h2> <ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-px border border-rule bg-rule p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\"> <li class=\"bg-white p-5\"> <h3 class=\"text-base\"> <a href=\"/calculators/sole-trader-tax-calculator/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Sole trader </a> </h3> <p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Tax on your business profit, plus what to put aside for GST and the next PAYG instalment.</p> </li><li class=\"bg-white p-5\"> <h3 class=\"text-base\"> <a href=\"/calculators/gst-calculator/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> GST </a> </h3> <p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Add or remove GST, and see the GST-exclusive figure your BAS actually wants.</p> </li> </ul> </section><section class=\"shell mt-12\"> <div class=\"card p-6\"> <h2 class=\"text-lg\">Other services</h2> <div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"/services/company-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Company setup </a><a href=\"/services/abn-application/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> ABN application </a><a href=\"/services/gst-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> GST registration </a><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Trust setup </a><a href=\"/services/partnership-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Partnership setup </a><a href=\"/services/smsf/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Self-managed super fund </a> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">All services</a> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"shell mt-20\"> <div class=\"card p-6 sm:p-8\"> <div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] md:gap-12\"> <div> <p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Registered tax agent</p> <h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl\">A real practice, not a form that emails you a PDF</h2> <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[0.9375rem]\"> Every return is prepared and reviewed by a registered agent before it is lodged. Because we lodge on your behalf, you get the agent deadline rather than the 31 October one — that is roughly six extra months, and it is the single most common reason people switch. </p> <a href=\"/about/\" class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm\">Meet the accountant →</a> </div> <dl class=\"m-0 border-t border-rule\"> <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Tax agent number</dt> <dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">26233684</dd> </div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Agent lodgement deadline</dt> <dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">15 May 2027</dd> </div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Lodging yourself</dt> <dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">31 October 2026</dd> </div> </dl> </div> </div> </section></div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/bookkeeping/#service\",\"name\":\"Bookkeeping\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/bookkeeping/\",\"description\":\"Ongoing bookkeeping reconciled every month, not rebuilt every June. It keeps your BAS right, shows what you're earning and makes the annual return cheaper.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Australia\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"XYZ Accounting\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/\"}</script></div>\n"
